    "font" : "Arial-BoldMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Figure 6 is clearer for mode detection than Figure 7 and shows two modes occurring at 30.2 Hz and 63.5 Hz. This is consistent with the observed response showed in Fig 4 and 5."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
